    question_en: "A university operates an online learning portal where students located around the world submit final video capstone projects. The video files range from 10 GB to 25 GB in size. Students connecting over high-latency and unstable internet connections frequently experience upload timeouts, forcing them to restart the entire upload from the beginning. In addition, the university's cloud operations team discovered unexpected and continuously increasing Amazon S3 storage costs resulting from these failed and interrupted uploads.\n\nWhich solution should a solutions architect recommend to improve upload performance and reliability while eliminating the unnecessary storage costs?",
