      "Deploy Amazon API Gateway to expose the REST API and configure an AWS service integration to buffer incoming payloads directly into an Amazon Simple Queue Service (SQS) queue. Configure AWS Lambda functions to poll the SQS queue and process records asynchronously, and switch the DynamoDB table to on-demand capacity mode."
