      "Deploy a NAT gateway in a public subnet and configure the private subnet route tables with a default route (0.0.0.0/0) pointing to the NAT gateway. Create Gateway VPC Endpoints for Amazon DynamoDB and Amazon S3, and associate them with the private subnet route tables.",
